{"id": "17-3199-2-2", "zh": "tanu 等词根类", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3200-2-8", "zh": "tanu 意为扩展；与前面一样，删去词根末音，产生语尾。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3201-2-7", "zh": "520. 在 tanu 等词根之后，有 o 与 yira。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3202-2-10", "zh": "在 tanu 等这一词根类之后，表示施事（主动）时，有 o、yira 这两个词缀。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3202-11-14", "zh": "其中 yira 词缀只用在 kara 之后。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3203-2-6", "zh": "Dhammaṃ tanoti（他弘扬法），tanonti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3203-7-10", "zh": "Tanosi，tanotha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3203-11-14", "zh": "Tanomi，tanoma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3204-2-9", "zh": "“vā（或）”一词承前延续。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3205-2-7", "zh": "521. o 音变为 u。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3206-2-9", "zh": "在 tanu 等词根之后的 o 词缀可以选择变为 u。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3206-10-13", "zh": "这里的 vā 一词表示有限定的任选。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3206-14-26", "zh": "这里因为处在规定插入词缀运作的章节，所以“okāro”取的是插入词缀 o。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3206-27-41", "zh": "Tanute；复数时依“yavakārā ca”规则变为 v，得 tanvante。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3206-42-45", "zh": "Tanuse，tanuvhe。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3206-46-49", "zh": "Tanve，tanumhe。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3207-2-20", "zh": "表示受事（被动）时，依“kvaci dhātu”等规则，在 ya 之前，tanu 的词根末音变为 ā：patāyate，patāyante。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3207-21-24", "zh": "Patāyati，patāyanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3207-25-29", "zh": "不变为 ā 时：pataññati，pataññanti。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3207-30-33", "zh": "Tanotu，tanontu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3207-34-37", "zh": "Taneyya，taneyyuṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3207-38-41", "zh": "Atani，ataniṃsu。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3207-42-45", "zh": "Atāyittha，patāyi。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3207-46-49", "zh": "Tanissati，tanissanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3207-50-53", "zh": "Patāyissati，patāyissanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3207-54-55", "zh": "Atanissa。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3207-56-58", "zh": "Patāyissa 等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3208-2-7", "zh": "kara 意为做：puññaṃ karoti（他行善）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3209-2-19", "zh": "复数时，在“vā”承前延续的情况下，依“uttamokāro”规则变为 u 之后——", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3210-2-12", "zh": "“vā”与“uttaṃ”都承前延续。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3211-2-7", "zh": "522. kara 的 a 音也是如此。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3212-2-10", "zh": "kara 这个词根的 a 音可以选择变为 u。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3212-11-61", "zh": "这里的 vā 一词表示有限定的任选。依“yavakārā ca”规则，不在词末的后一个 u 音变为 v；依“kvaci dhātu”等规则，在 v 音之前删去词根的 r 音；v 音重叠后，再依“bbo vvassa”规则变为两个 b：kubbanti，karonti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3212-62-65", "zh": "Karosi，karotha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3212-66-69", "zh": "Karomi，karoma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3212-70-74", "zh": "同样有 kurute，kubbante。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3212-75-78", "zh": "Kuruse，kuruvhe。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3212-79-82", "zh": "Kubbe，kurumhe。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3212-83-92", "zh": "用 yira 词缀时删去 r 音：kayirati，kayiranti 等等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3213-2-26", "zh": "表示受事时，在 ya 词缀之前依“ivaṇṇāgamo vā”规则增加 ī 音，ya 音重叠：karīyyate kaṭo tena（席子由他编成），karīyyati，karīyyanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3213-27-31", "zh": "或者 karīyati，karīyanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3213-32-46", "zh": "不增加 ī 音时，依“tassa cavagga”等规则，连同词根末音一起变为 y，并且重叠。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3213-47-50", "zh": "Kayyati，kayyanti。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3213-51-71", "zh": "增加 i 音时，依“kvaci dhātu”等规则中的 ca 字，r 与 y 互换位置：kayirati kaṭo tena（席子由他编成），kayiranti 等等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3214-2-12", "zh": "同样有 kusalaṃ karotu（愿他行善），或者 kurutu，kubbantu，karontu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3214-13-16", "zh": "Karohi，karotha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3214-17-20", "zh": "Karomi，karoma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3214-21-24", "zh": "Kurutaṃ，kubbantaṃ。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3214-25-31", "zh": "Kurussu，或者 kurassu，kuruvho。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3214-32-35", "zh": "Kubbe，kubbāmase。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3215-2-12", "zh": "表示受事时：karīyatu，karīyantu，kayyataṃ，kayirataṃ，kayiratu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3216-2-8", "zh": "在祈愿式（sattamī）中：kare，kareyya，kareyyuṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3216-9-12", "zh": "Kareyyāsi，kareyyātha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3216-13-16", "zh": "Kareyyāmi，kareyyāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3216-17-22", "zh": "变为 u 时：kubbe，kubbeyya。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3217-2-4", "zh": "用 yira 词缀时——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-3218-2-6", "zh": "在 yira 之后，eyya 变为 ā；在 etha 等与 eyyuṃ 等语尾中，", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3219-2-13", "zh": "依“kvaci dhātu”等规则，删去 eyya 这一成分。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-3220-2-7", "zh": "再删去元音等：kayirā，kayiruṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3220-8-11", "zh": "Kayirāsi，kayirātha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3220-12-15", "zh": "Kayirāmi，kayirāma。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3220-16-39", "zh": "为自言（attanopada）时：kayirātha dhīro（智者应当去做），kubbetha，或者 karetha；依“kvaci dhātu”等规则，ku 也变为 kru：krubbetha，krubberaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-3220-40-43", "zh": "Krubbetho，krubbeyyāvho。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3220-44-47", "zh": "Krubbeyyaṃ，krubbeyyāmhe。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3220-48-52", "zh": "表示受事时：karīyeyya，karīyeyyuṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3221-2-16", "zh": "在未完成过去时（hiyyattanī）中，依拆分“karassa kā”的规则变为 kā，再删去元音等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3222-2-7", "zh": "Akā，akarā，akarū。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3222-8-13", "zh": "Akaro，akattha，akarottha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3222-14-21", "zh": "Akaṃ，akaraṃ，akamha，akaramha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3222-22-23", "zh": "Akattha。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3222-24-27", "zh": "Akariṃ，akaramhase。", "confidence": 95}
{"id": "17-3223-2-9", "zh": "“vā”承前延续。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-3224-2-7", "zh": "523. 在不定过去时中，kara 变为 kāsa。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3225-2-13", "zh": "当不定过去时（ajjatanī）语尾在后时，kara 这个词根整个可以选择变为 kāsa。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-3225-14-25", "zh": "由于“kāsatta”是用抽象名词的形式表述的，所以在其他词根之后也会增加 s 音。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-3225-26-79", "zh": "或者，当意思是“在不定过去时中，kara 可以变为 kā，并且增加 s 音”时，那么依拆分“sattamajjatanimhi”的规则，在其他词根之后增加 s 音也能成立；而依“由拆分规则达成所需的形式”，这大多只发生在长音之后；此外，依拆分“karassa kā”的规则，在未完成过去时中变为 kā 的情形也得以成立。", "confidence": 65}
